77053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老学庵北窗杂书七首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"茅斋遥夜养心君，静处工夫自策勋。\n正喜残香伴幽独，鸦鸣窗白又纷纷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4954,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老学庵北窗杂书七首 其五","author":"陆游","text":"定交鱼鸟欲忘形，独岸纶巾坐草亭。\n不恨囊中无赤仄，且欣案上有黄庭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4955,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老学庵北窗杂书七首 其六","author":"陆游","text":"松棚接屋得阴多，石径生苔奈滑何。\n尽道疏篱宜细雨，晴时最好晒渔蓑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4956,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老学庵北窗杂书七首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"偶住人间遂许时，残骸自笑尚支持。\n直须消破黄齑尽，始是浮生结局时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4957,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老将二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"百战西归变姓名，悲歌击筑醉湖城。\n貂裘换得金鸦觜，种药南山待太平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4958,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老将二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"忆昔东都有事宜，夜传帛诏起西师。\n功名无分身空在，犹指金创说战时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4959,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}